ParentVault_freezePolicy
├── freeze administration
│   ├── non-compliance-operator should not be able to freeze an account
│   └── compliance-operator should be able to freeze an account
├── when a KYC-approved caller is frozen
│   ├── deposit should revert through policy
│   ├── withdraw should revert through policy
│   ├── claimShares should revert through policy
│   ├── claimAsset should revert through policy
│   ├── cancelDeposit should revert through policy
│   └── cancelWithdraw should revert through policy
└── policy wiring
    └── each ParentVault user selector should install freeze, KYC, then terminal allow
